# Environment & Configuration Management

## 📁 Structure Pattern với Config Loading
```
/.env                           # Root config (shared)
/backend/.env                   # Backend-specific  
/frontend/.env                  # Frontend-specific
/database/.env                  # Database-specific
scripts/utils/config-loader.sh  # Advanced config management
```

## 🔧 Configuration Inheritance với Config Loader

### Config Loader Functions
```bash
# Load global config với inheritance
source scripts/utils/config-loader.sh
load_global_config        # Load root .env + .env.local

# Load service-specific config
load_service_config "backend"    # Load global + backend/.env
load_service_config "frontend"   # Load global + frontend/.env

# Enhanced env loading với proper quoted values handling
load_env_file              # Auto-detect .env.local or .env
load_env_file ".env.prod"  # Specific env file
```

### Root Configuration (.env)
```bash
# Project identification
PROJECT_NAME="QLDSV-HTC"

# Database settings
DB_HOST=localhost
DB_PORT=1434
DB_NAME=QLDSV_HTC
DB_CONTAINER_NAME=qldsv-sqlserver
DOCKER_NETWORK=qldsv-network

# Service ports
BACKEND_PORT=8000
FRONTEND_PORT=5173

# Database credentials
MSSQL_SA_PASSWORD="YourStrongPassword123!"
MSSQL_APP_USER="app_user"
MSSQL_APP_PASSWORD="AppPassword123!"
```

### Backend (.env)
```bash
# Database connection với inheritance từ root
DATABASE_URL="mssql+pyodbc://${MSSQL_APP_USER}:${MSSQL_APP_PASSWORD}@${DB_HOST}:${DB_PORT}/${DB_NAME}"
SQLALCHEMY_POOL_SIZE=10
LOG_LEVEL=DEBUG
FASTAPI_DEBUG=true
FASTAPI_RELOAD=true

# Backend service config
BACKEND_HOST=0.0.0.0
BACKEND_API_URL="http://localhost:${BACKEND_PORT}"
```

### Frontend (.env)
```bash
